1
00:00:00,900 --> 00:00:02,133
Didn't you say this was for security?

2
00:00:02,133 --> 00:00:03,000
Why are you stopping me?

3
00:00:05,100 --> 00:00:06,833
Hear me out first. Don't rush off.

4
00:00:08,433 --> 00:00:10,800
If you never finish, I'll be trapped here forever.

5
00:00:11,400 --> 00:00:14,900
The exits are guarded. Don't force your way out. I'll talk to Sir.

6
00:00:22,800 --> 00:00:25,700
I'll record the exact time, and your things will be kept safe.

7
00:00:26,100 --> 00:00:26,966
You took them by force.

8
00:00:27,366 --> 00:00:28,366
Don't say I gave them up willingly.

9
00:00:31,366 --> 00:00:33,266
Note down one more thing: I'm leaving right now.

10
00:00:38,666 --> 00:00:40,666
I'll pass your words to Sir, word for word.

11
00:00:51,433 --> 00:00:51,733
Ah Tan!

12
00:00:52,333 --> 00:00:53,400
Did you hear me? Open the door!

13
00:00:55,000 --> 00:00:56,666
You coaxed me back, and now you won't let me leave.

14
00:00:57,300 --> 00:00:58,266
Where's your apology?

15
00:00:58,333 --> 00:00:59,866
Did you forget all about it?

16
00:00:59,900 --> 00:01:01,933
Don't cry, Nawin. Let's get him to open the door first.

17
00:01:10,166 --> 00:01:13,800
The butler passed it along, but the thought of you leaving terrifies me.

18
00:01:14,100 --> 00:01:14,800
So you just lock me up?

19
00:01:15,400 --> 00:01:17,500
Ah Tan, I thought you cared about me.

20
00:01:20,200 --> 00:01:22,200
I'm a jerk. I'm sorry.

21
00:01:23,766 --> 00:01:26,100
Don't make me wait any longer. Go open the door.

22
00:01:29,900 --> 00:01:31,200
Panin, bring his things over.
